      <metadata>
        <description>{\rtf1\ansi Pitch Canvas Extension \u8212? Adaptive Precision\par Adaptive pitch control for VST3 instruments in REAPER.\par Helps VST3 instruments follow Pitch Canvas curves more closely while keeping them in your regular REAPER FX chain.\par Compare Off and Adaptive on a short passage, listen to the result, and save your choice.\par Experimental. Install Pitch Canvas separately. Restart REAPER, then run the Adaptive Precision action.\par macOS Intel/Apple Silicon and Windows x64. Read the bundled README and EULA before use.}</description>
        <link rel="website">https://github.com/PontakuAudio/PitchCanvas-Extension-Adaptive-Precision</link>
      </metadata>
